# fonts/*.ttf, fonts/*.otf, and data/metrics.db are gitignored by default so
# a fresh local dev checkout doesn't accidentally commit re-downloads, but a
# built snapshot IS force-added and committed (git add -f) for deployment -
# see README's "Deploying" section. Don't `git rm` them without re-reading
# that section first.
fonts/*.ttf
fonts/*.otf
data/*.db
output/*.png
output/uploads/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

.claude/
